WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:50.190
Someone once said:

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:55.020
There are scallops, with a deep, rich flavor,

00:01:55.020 --> 00:02:00.360
that glitter as brilliantly 
as flecks of gold...

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:04.030
Gold Bullion Scallops!

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:11.540
There is a treat to the 
tongue, multicolored tapioca,

00:02:11.540 --> 00:02:15.840
that flows along the river 
of coconut milk on a hill...

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:18.750
Tapioca Pudding Pike!

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:21.780
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:26.790
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:28.890 --> 00:02:31.320
Toriko and Komatsu visited Gourmet Town and

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:35.930
filled up on legendary Century 
Soup at Setsuno's Diner.

00:02:35.930 --> 00:02:39.530
However, that soup was still incomplete.

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:43.740
Toriko and Komatsu agreed to 
obtain the real Century Soup,

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:45.470
which exists in nature.

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:50.180
They head to a saloon to meet a 
person who has information on it.

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:54.180
Meeting at the Saloon!

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:57.080
Rivalry Between Gourmet Hunters!

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:13.630
Hey!

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:15.370
Ain't that Match?!

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:23.480
Hey! Booze!

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:25.110
Bring out the booze!

00:03:25.710 --> 00:03:27.410
I don't got enough eats either!

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:30.550
Who the hell do you think I am, huh?!

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:32.550
I'm Bourbo-sama!

00:03:41.630 --> 00:03:43.090
I win!

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:45.530
Ain't there anybody who 
can eat more than me?!

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:46.760
Stow it!

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:49.830
You louts are too frickin' noisy...

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:52.500
Can't you drink more quietly?!

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:56.070
Who the hell are you?

00:03:56.070 --> 00:03:57.540
I haven't seen your mug around here before.

00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:01.010
What?! You don't know who I am, ya say?!

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:04.450
This is Zonge-sama and he's 
famous the world over!

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:06.280
Nobody knows this fruitcake.

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:09.520
Whatever, Zonge-san...

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:12.790
It's Zombie! How many times 
do I have to tell you people?!

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:15.020
Wait, he had it right!

00:04:17.760 --> 00:04:19.160
Hey, boy...

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:21.930
You don't mind giving up 
that table for us, do ya?

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:26.370
This joint ain't meant to be 
for kiddies in the first place.

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:31.510
I'm old enough to drink alcohol.

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:34.140
Why don't you try to move me?

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:36.780
Don't be a hard-ass.

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:40.320
You don't wanna end up with 
a kisser like mine, do ya?

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:43.790
Having a lot of scars is 
a testament to weakness.

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:46.690
You must be lousy at defending 
yourself, old man.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:51.560
All right. Just remember, you're 
the one who banged the gong.

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:02.600
Jeez!

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:05.310
The client's gonna be here any minute!

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:38.170
What's up?!

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:39.770
T-Toriko?!

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:40.640
The real guy?!

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:41.310
It's really Toriko!

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:49.320
It's Toriko!

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:55.620
Charisma's in the house!

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:58.660
Too long since I've been at the Heavy Lodge!

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:00.660
It's as lively as ever!

00:06:00.930 --> 00:06:02.400
I'm impressed!

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:04.700
Everyone knows you, Toriko!

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:06.070
Toriko...

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:10.170
The one person even the leader of 
the Gourmet Knights looks up to...

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:13.070
Of course.

00:06:14.010 --> 00:06:15.810
He's one of the Four Kings.

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:19.340
Long time ago, I picked a fight 
with one of the Four Kings.

00:06:19.910 --> 00:06:21.880
I thought that was gonna be the end of me.

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:24.120
The guy's name was Zebra.

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:27.650
All the scars on my body were 
given to me that one time.

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:29.450
And with just one blow...

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:33.830
Yo, Master! Long time no see!

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:36.460
There you go! Enamel Beer!

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:38.130
Drink up, Toriko!

00:06:38.900 --> 00:06:40.870
How long's it been?! I've missed you!

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:44.800
These days, I get plenty of work 
without having to come here.

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:49.040
Don't be so cold!

00:06:49.210 --> 00:06:51.380
I want you to drop by even 
if it isn't work-related.

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:52.440
Another one!

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:53.950
That was fast!

00:06:54.110 --> 00:06:56.910
Yo! We meet again!

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:58.050
Hanage!

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:59.050
Note: hanage = nose hair

00:06:58.250 --> 00:06:59.050
It's Zonge!

00:06:59.050 --> 00:07:02.550
You only got the "ge" part 
right! Why just the last part?!

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:05.690
So what are you doing here?

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:07.660
I've got business!

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:10.790
I heard somebody's dyin' 
to hire me and my crew.

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:14.970
Anyway, looks like the people around 
here are passing familiar with you.

00:07:14.970 --> 00:07:18.100
Toriko knows that gorilla?

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:18.470
They were makin' some fuss over you...

00:07:18.340 --> 00:07:19.500
You got me.

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:22.270
But they're sure talkin' 
like know each other.

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:24.470
But in my village, not a 
single soul knows your name.

00:07:24.470 --> 00:07:28.950
I'm so famous there, they 
treat me like a god, see...

00:07:28.950 --> 00:07:30.150
You're more than a god!

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:31.680
So tell me, Master...

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:31.850
Though it's a really tiny village...

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:33.050
That's right... Hey!

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:33.680
How's the current crop of Gourmet Hunters?

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:34.850
Still, you're a god, Zonge-sama!

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:35.890
Bunch of milk-toasts...

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:36.850
That's right! A tiny god!

00:07:35.990 --> 00:07:37.890
I don't really see any of 'em

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:39.420
Hey! There's that mouth again!

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:41.560
having what it takes to be 
like one of you Four Kings.

00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:40.790
We have nothing but praise 
for you, Zonge-sama!

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:43.630
If that's what a good judge of 
character like you says, Moriji,

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:44.990
there are no two ways about it.

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:50.570
"Master"... Does he act as a go-between 
with Gourmet Hunters and clients too?

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:51.170
Yeah.

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:54.270
When it comes to Gourmet Hunters, 
nobody's got a better eye

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:57.170
for spotting their talent than 
Moriji, and he gets work for 'em.

00:07:57.170 --> 00:08:02.040
Toriko, I can see you've gotten a 
lot more powerful since last time.

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:03.480
You can tell?

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:04.750
Incidentally...

00:08:05.050 --> 00:08:07.350
Tonight's customers are all 
here for the same purpose.

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:09.580
I'm sure that's why you're here, too.

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:12.420
Yeah. I'm looking for work...

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:15.460
...from the guy who's on the 
other side of that door.

00:08:25.430 --> 00:08:27.500
Everyone, stop eating!

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:30.710
The President of Gourfill Inc...

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:32.810
Colonel Mokkoi!

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:51.830
H-He's the president of Gourfill?!

00:08:52.060 --> 00:08:52.960
Him?

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:55.400
The old man who was on a spending 
spree at the department store.

00:08:57.230 --> 00:09:00.500
I'll pay 100 billion yen to the 
person who fulfills my request.

00:09:01.030 --> 00:09:01.870
100 billion?!

00:09:02.170 --> 00:09:03.300
100 billion yen, he said?!

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:04.900
Seriously?!

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:06.670
How many zeros is that?!

00:09:12.050 --> 00:09:13.550
Come to the harbor tomorrow.

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:15.450
I won't turn anyone down!

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:17.650
That amount ain't no bull, is it?!

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:18.580
Stupid question!

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:21.250
Who the hell do you think I am?!

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:23.820
Century Soup!

00:09:24.260 --> 00:09:26.430
Anybody who wants a good challenge, 
I'll see you tomorrow.

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:34.800
You're not going to have a test?

00:09:36.270 --> 00:09:37.640
I'll bring 'em all.

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:43.840
I wanna increase the chances of finding 
Century Soup, even if it's by 0.1%.

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:49.950
Besides, I'm sure they'll be 
sifted through soon enough...

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:52.780
by unforgiving Nature.

00:09:58.390 --> 00:10:01.030
Be careful out there, Toriko.

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:02.630
Excuse me...

00:10:03.230 --> 00:10:05.630
Can I go with?

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:09.030
You're a Gourmet Hunter?

00:10:09.130 --> 00:10:11.770
N-No! I should have said before.

00:10:11.900 --> 00:10:14.000
My name is Komatsu and I'm a chef.

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:16.810
A chef?

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:18.140
I see.

00:10:18.580 --> 00:10:22.380
You're weak, but it feels like you've 
got something to contribute...

00:10:25.380 --> 00:10:26.580
It's strange...

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:29.320
For many years now, I've 
seen people go on journeys.

00:10:29.990 --> 00:10:32.560
Some, I've wanted to hold back.

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:37.330
And some, like you, I've wanted 
to give a supportive push.

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:39.360
You wanna go, go!

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:41.160
Thank you!

00:10:42.630 --> 00:10:44.230
Good for you, right, Komatsu?

00:10:44.400 --> 00:10:46.200
Right!!

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:54.740
It may turn out to be a rough trip...

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:56.850
Toriko...

00:10:57.680 --> 00:10:58.750
I want to show you something.

00:10:59.320 --> 00:11:02.420
Sure. Want to come along, Komatsu?

00:11:28.180 --> 00:11:29.310
Wow!

00:11:30.610 --> 00:11:33.380
Moriji sells equipment to Gourmet Hunters.

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:34.520
Huh...

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:36.920
You should go out there fully equipped.

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:39.690
Knocking Guns are so expensive!

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:45.990
That's the thing Coco-san 
used with the Puffer Whale!

00:11:46.090 --> 00:11:46.760
Expensive!

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:48.130
What's this?

00:11:48.800 --> 00:11:50.660
It's called a Gourmet Stick.

00:11:51.830 --> 00:11:53.970
Gourmet Stick?

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:11.380
Protein

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:11.380
Sugar

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:11.380
Iron

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:11.380
Measuring

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:11.380
Fat

00:11:59.370 --> 00:12:01.940
Protein... 23%.

00:12:02.840 --> 00:12:05.210
Fat... 67%.

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:08.780
Iron... 0.1%.

00:12:09.220 --> 00:12:11.420
More and more information is coming out!

00:12:15.190 --> 00:12:19.060
Growlrus: Length 7.8 m, Weight 8.5 
t, Height 4.1 m, Mammalian Beast

00:12:16.720 --> 00:12:19.060
That's a Growlrus Fillet, isn't it?!

00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:22.360
This item knows everything 
about every ingredient.

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:26.130
This could come in handy for 
locating the Century Soup...

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:27.400
We'll take it!

00:12:29.700 --> 00:12:33.740
My chance to eat at Setsuko's Diner...

00:12:34.370 --> 00:12:36.640
I'm sorry, but we're closed.

00:12:38.240 --> 00:12:41.610
It can't be helped. We're out of meat!

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:43.820
Some rich bastard bought it all up!

00:12:44.420 --> 00:12:46.890
By the way, I heard Toriko was here.

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:48.320
Toriko?!

00:12:57.560 --> 00:12:59.300
This outfit is perfect, isn't it?

00:13:05.100 --> 00:13:09.210
I'm grateful for your courage 
and spirit, everyone.

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:13.240
This is delicious!

00:13:13.240 --> 00:13:14.610
The best!

00:13:14.610 --> 00:13:15.780
It's fit for a king!

00:13:15.780 --> 00:13:18.520
I've always wanted to try 
Garlic Chicken and Egg Bowl!

00:13:19.350 --> 00:13:22.720
Setsuno's Diner... This 
is like a dream come true!

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:24.720
I'm gonna blog about this!

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:26.960
And I'll read every word!

00:13:27.390 --> 00:13:29.290
Guys, we're at the place itself!

00:13:30.230 --> 00:13:33.360
Setsuno-sama, thank you!

00:13:35.300 --> 00:13:36.930
The idea of young people setting 
out on a journey made me so happy,

00:13:36.930 --> 00:13:38.600
I wanted to do something...

00:13:39.700 --> 00:13:47.380
And soon, I'm sure you'll be able 
to eat more delicious Century Soup!

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:22.750
What's this?

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:29.850
It's a suit!

00:14:29.850 --> 00:14:30.890
Well, everyone...

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:34.620
I will now tell you the 
whereabouts of the Century Soup.

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:37.030
Right now, we're heading for...

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:39.390
Ice Hell.

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:41.400
Ice Hell?!

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:44.170
The frigid hellscape that freezes everything!

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:46.130
Hmph. Where the hell is it?

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:49.100
Another name for it is 
"Gourmet Refrigerator".

00:14:50.440 --> 00:14:52.640
Gourmet Hunters from long, 
long ago didn't have

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:54.640
the cold storage technology that we do today.

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:57.780
It's a legendary continent 
where Hunters would bring

00:14:57.780 --> 00:14:59.980
the ingredients for their 
full course to be preserved.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:05.390
A multitude of ingredients are stored 
in the icebergs in the central region.

00:15:06.150 --> 00:15:11.490
The ice gives off a radiance, as if to 
display the catches of our predecessors.

00:15:11.490 --> 00:15:14.060
Another name for it is "Gourmet Window".

00:15:14.960 --> 00:15:18.170
We know that it melts 
once every hundred years.

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:24.100
The cause is the release of Hell Methane 
Hydrate, the so-called "Burning Ice".

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:28.170
Because of that, the thawed-out ingredients 
come together in a pool and that,

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:30.640
as a matter of fact, is Century Soup.

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:33.950
To reiterate, Hell Methane Hydrate,

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:37.750
which is only released once every 
100 years, creates Century Soup!

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:42.690
No matter what you have 
to do, find Century Soup!

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:48.590
Yeesh! The intelligence network 
of rich people is amazing.

00:15:48.730 --> 00:15:53.430
Yep. And I'm impressed he thought to 
prepare all these weatherized goods.

00:15:53.570 --> 00:15:54.970
Rider Suits...

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:58.370
The layered materials rub against each 
other, creating a frictional force

00:15:58.370 --> 00:16:00.610
that makes the whole suit 
stay at a high temperature.

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:03.740
Yeah, I'm not cold at all!

00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:12.880
But it's too bad they don't 
have them for the horses.

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:15.190
H-Horse? Why is a horse here?

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:17.190
Hello, Toriko-san.

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:19.860
I'm Takimaru, a Gourmet Knight.

00:16:20.930 --> 00:16:22.060
A Gourmet Knight, eh?

00:16:22.260 --> 00:16:23.830
Gourmet Knight?

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:28.100
Led by a man named Aimaru,

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:30.300
they're a group that holds 
natural food in high regard.

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:34.270
Their number is few, but they 
all possess a strong spirit.

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:36.640
Huh... Really?

00:16:36.940 --> 00:16:38.880
I'm surprised one of their 
members is so young.

00:16:39.380 --> 00:16:41.150
I just joined recently.

00:16:41.150 --> 00:16:42.050
I see...

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:43.350
How is Ai doing?

00:16:45.220 --> 00:16:47.590
Oh... Our leader is doing well.

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:51.460
I think he'd be surprised if 
he knew I met you, Toriko-san.

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:01.470
A Sharkrocodile...

00:17:00.760 --> 00:17:03.930
Sharkcrocodile (Fish Beat) Capture Level

00:17:01.530 --> 00:17:03.470
This guy is delicious served raw.

00:17:04.700 --> 00:17:10.040
I give thanks for this world's bounty!

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:22.750
Knocking...

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:23.790
complete!

00:17:24.290 --> 00:17:26.990
Incredible! Knocking with one finger...

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:30.930
What?!

00:17:48.240 --> 00:17:50.150
Take that! And that! And that! And that!

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:53.650
Z-Zonge-sama!

00:17:53.980 --> 00:17:54.820
Eat this!

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:57.090
Zonge Smash!

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:08.600
Now! Come on!

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:09.700
Strategic retreat!

00:18:09.700 --> 00:18:11.470
As far away as possible!

00:18:12.670 --> 00:18:14.570
This time, I'll get a scoop for sure!

00:18:15.970 --> 00:18:17.570
Noisy on deck...

00:18:21.840 --> 00:18:22.510
Match-san!

00:18:27.450 --> 00:18:28.050
Match-san!

00:18:30.820 --> 00:18:33.220
I'm gonna fillet you!

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:44.330
Match-san!

00:18:45.230 --> 00:18:47.030
Take care of the rest for me.

00:18:47.030 --> 00:18:47.630
Yes, sir.

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:11.260
Corkscrew Shot!

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:33.140
You disconnected their bones!

00:19:33.580 --> 00:19:35.880
The concentration required to 
pull off a trick like that...

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:38.850
Probably only a member of the 
Gourmet Knights could do it.

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:40.120
Toriko-san!

00:19:40.750 --> 00:19:43.050
It's chaos out here!

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:45.720
I'd think you'd be used to stuff 
like this by now, Komatsu!

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:47.790
Huh?

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:53.630
I'm not used to it!

00:19:55.300 --> 00:19:57.800
Three-Fold Spiked Punch!

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:14.850
Hey! Everyone, look at this!

00:20:17.490 --> 00:20:19.290
Could that be...

00:20:19.390 --> 00:20:19.960
Yes!

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:25.600
That's the continent of ice...

00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:27.030
Ice Hell!

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:30.870
I-It's huge!

00:20:31.270 --> 00:20:33.400
It's really something, huh, Toriko-san?

00:20:33.800 --> 00:20:36.040
And we're gonna climb it...

00:20:36.470 --> 00:20:38.440
I pray for your Food Luck.

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:04.800
T-T-T-Toriko-san!!

00:21:17.450 --> 00:21:23.120
Is the night wind, caressing my cheek

00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:29.390
proof the world is spinning, I wonder?

00:21:30.120 --> 00:21:36.630
Each time I move out, the 
direction of the wind changes.

00:21:37.030 --> 00:21:41.570
Maybe that’s telling me something.

00:21:42.840 --> 00:21:46.670
I was searching for what happiness meant.

00:21:46.670 --> 00:21:50.040
Aiming for the island in my dreams,

00:21:50.040 --> 00:21:54.510
on a journey with no end!

00:21:56.350 --> 00:21:59.490
Blown by the winds of tomorrow,

00:21:59.490 --> 00:22:02.620
drifting off to who-knows-where,

00:22:02.620 --> 00:22:08.630
amid the waves of time.

00:22:11.660 --> 00:22:13.600
Gourmet News.

00:22:14.770 --> 00:22:16.500
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:16.640 --> 00:22:18.940
The liver of a Sharkrocodile is scrumptious.

00:22:19.070 --> 00:22:20.510
It tastes like foie gras.

00:22:21.110 --> 00:22:24.740
I'll introduce you here to a 
simple way to enjoy that flavor.

00:22:25.310 --> 00:22:27.580
First, prepare cream cheese.

00:22:27.710 --> 00:22:29.880
Here's a quiz!

00:22:30.150 --> 00:22:33.350
What can you add cream cheese to in 
order to get the taste of foie gras?

00:22:33.920 --> 00:22:35.620
Number 1... Japanese salad dressing.

00:22:36.190 --> 00:22:37.920
Number 2... Vegetable and fruit sauce.

00:22:38.790 --> 00:22:40.530
Or number 3... Curry roux.

00:22:41.760 --> 00:22:42.830
The answer is...

00:22:44.530 --> 00:22:47.100
Number 1! Japanese salad dressing.

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:49.770
Everyone, please try this at home.

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:56.510
It's a heaping helping of deliciousness!

00:22:56.610 --> 00:23:00.240
It's so soft, smooth, creamy...

00:23:02.610 --> 00:23:04.320
Now, on to the next story!

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:08.950
The Gourmet Hunters take on Ice Hell.

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:11.210
And the Gourmet Corps are joining in, too!?

00:23:11.210 --> 00:23:13.020
This keeps getting worse!

00:23:13.310 --> 00:23:16.990
Challenge of the Gourmet Hunter Army! Disembarking at Freezing Hell!

00:23:17.480 --> 00:23:19.310
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
